  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rainforest Journalism Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund supports journalists globaly and in forest countries, to create a deeper understanding of the forces at play behind deforestation and forest degradation aroundt the world.</narrative>
  </description>
